sequenceDiagram
    actor S as Student
    participant B as Installed PWA
    participant C as Service worker cache
    participant A as /api/push
    participant Q as Server queue
    participant P as Browser push service

    S->>B: Turn on reminders in Settings
    B->>P: Subscribe with the VAPID public key
    P-->>B: Push address
    B->>C: Save reminder texts on the device
    B->>A: Push address, opaque ids and times only
    A->>Q: Store
    Note over Q: Assignment text never reaches the server
    Q->>P: At the due time, wake the device with the id
    P->>C: Service worker wakes up
    C-->>S: Looks up the text, shows the notification
